# Stack: Android (Kotlin, Jetpack Compose) in `{{ path }}/`

- Kotlin, Jetpack Compose with Material 3, minSdk {{ android_min_sdk }}. Single-activity app.
- Architecture: UI (Composables) -> ViewModel (StateFlow) -> repository.
  Coroutines for async work. Feature packages under `{{ bundle_id }}`.
- Declare dependencies in `gradle/libs.versions.toml` only. Never hard-code
  versions in build files.
- Tests: JUnit unit tests in `app/src/test/`, Compose UI tests in `app/src/androidTest/`.
- Check: `scripts/check.sh android-kotlin` (lint + unit tests). Needs a JDK and
  the Android SDK (`ANDROID_HOME`). The check is skipped if they're missing.
